  "description": "Pumpkin puree is turned into a creamy, smooth sauce with just a hint of cloves, nutmeg, and cinnamon. Toss with whole wheat pasta and Parmesan cheese, and you&#39;ve got a kid-pleasing meal in under 30 minutes.",
